sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Operator
  participant J as Cloud Run job (add-admins)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant T as Operator's terminal
  participant F as Firebase Auth
  actor Ad as New admin
  participant W as Web
  participant API as ProofPocket API
  O->>J: deploy.sh admins EMAIL…
  J->>DB: insert users (role admin, must_change_password, expires in 7 days), existing emails skipped
  J-->>O: created / skipped (emails only, no secrets in logs)
  O->>T: set temporary passwords (runs locally)
  T->>F: create or update user (random 16+ chars, mixed case, digits, symbols)
  T-->>O: email + temporary password table, printed once
  Ad->>W: Sign in with the temporary password
  W->>F: signInWithEmailAndPassword
  W->>API: GET /me → mustChangePassword: true
  W->>W: Change password screen (nothing else reachable)
  Ad->>W: Temporary + new password
  W->>API: POST /auth/password (fresh sign-in, password rules, new ≠ temporary)
  API->>F: updateUser(uid, password)
  API->>DB: password_changed() clears the flag, audit user.password_changed
  W->>F: Sign in again with the new password (temporary one no longer works)
  W->>W: Google Authenticator set-up, then the admin portal
  Note over API,DB: Expired (after 7 days): every request is refused with temp_password_expired until the operator re-issues one
